        "name": "support_agent",
        "description": "SPEC-SC-002: a support-console agent -- queue/triage/assign/transition UI, no admin-only affordances."
      },
      {
        "name": "support_admin",
        "description": "SPEC-SC-002: a support-console admin -- everything support_agent has plus admin-only affordances (e.g. reassignment across teams, reconciliation triggers)."
